{"5087650": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ReMasterOfGame", "steam_appid": 5087650, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In ReMasterOfGame, the rabbit has long understood that no one but him will clear mountains of trash, clean puddles, or carry a precious ingredient across the whole location.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5087650/extras/329871af9731560ca9f85a1e436324ae.avif?t=1787123850\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5087650/extras_big/329871af9731560ca9f85a1e436324ae.webp?t=1787123850 width=1560 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore interconnected 2D locations, travel freely between them by elevator, meet NPCs, and take on their tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locations live their own lives while you are away, and even cleaned-up places get cluttered again. Find a balance and decide whether this world can be put in order. And whether it should be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5087650/extras/978dcfbe4e2b425aeb9b744a58c2d0b2.avif?t=1787123850\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5087650/extras_big/978dcfbe4e2b425aeb9b744a58c2d0b2.webp?t=1787123850 width=1560 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5087650/extras/6198ec5e2e2eced839021738143ffb9c.webp?t=1787123850\" width=16 height=16 /></span> Talk to NPCs, accept quests, and track your progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5087650/extras/6198ec5e2e2eced839021738143ffb9c.webp?t=1787123850\" width=16 height=16 /></span> Pick up, carry, throw, and deliver items to the right places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5087650/extras/6198ec5e2e2eced839021738143ffb9c.webp?t=1787123850\" width=16 height=16 /></span> Solve environmental challenges through cleaning, mechanisms, object linking, and spatial puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5087650/extras/6198ec5e2e2eced839021738143ffb9c.webp?t=1787123850\" width=16 height=16 /></span> Use elevators and other interactive elements of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5087650/extras/6198ec5e2e2eced839021738143ffb9c.webp?t=1787123850\" width=16 height=16 /></span> Watch the world change: completed actions persist when moving between locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5087650/extras/6198ec5e2e2eced839021738143ffb9c.webp?t=1787123850\" width=16 height=16 /></span> Open the quest journal and return to active tasks at any time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5087650/extras/b3c3de8a4b05ea203d90b8b0ae0e055c.avif?t=1787123850\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5087650/extras_big/b3c3de8a4b05ea203d90b8b0ae0e055c.webp?t=1787123850 width=1560 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You do not need to save the universe with one heroic jump. Sometimes it is enough to deliver the right things without dropping them, start a mechanism, and remember where you threw your mop when leaving this location last time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In ReMasterOfGame, the rabbit has long understood that no one but him will clear mountains of trash, clean puddles, or carry a precious ingredient across the whole location.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5087650/extras/329871af9731560ca9f85a1e436324ae.avif?t=1787123850\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5087650/extras_big/329871af9731560ca9f85a1e436324ae.webp?t=1787123850 width=1560 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore interconnected 2D locations, travel freely between them by elevator, meet NPCs, and take on their tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locations live their own lives while you are away, and even cleaned-up places get cluttered again. Find a balance and decide whether this world can be put in order. And whether it should be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5087650/extras/978dcfbe4e2b425aeb9b744a58c2d0b2.avif?t=1787123850\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5087650/extras_big/978dcfbe4e2b425aeb9b744a58c2d0b2.webp?t=1787123850 width=1560 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5087650/extras/6198ec5e2e2eced839021738143ffb9c.webp?t=1787123850\" width=16 height=16 /></span> Talk to NPCs, accept quests, and track your progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5087650/extras/6198ec5e2e2eced839021738143ffb9c.webp?t=1787123850\" width=16 height=16 /></span> Pick up, carry, throw, and deliver items to the right places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5087650/extras/6198ec5e2e2eced839021738143ffb9c.webp?t=1787123850\" width=16 height=16 /></span> Solve environmental challenges through cleaning, mechanisms, object linking, and spatial puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5087650/extras/6198ec5e2e2eced839021738143ffb9c.webp?t=1787123850\" width=16 height=16 /></span> Use elevators and other interactive elements of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5087650/extras/6198ec5e2e2eced839021738143ffb9c.webp?t=1787123850\" width=16 height=16 /></span> Watch the world change: completed actions persist when moving between locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5087650/extras/6198ec5e2e2eced839021738143ffb9c.webp?t=1787123850\" width=16 height=16 /></span> Open the quest journal and return to active tasks at any time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5087650/extras/b3c3de8a4b05ea203d90b8b0ae0e055c.avif?t=1787123850\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5087650/extras_big/b3c3de8a4b05ea203d90b8b0ae0e055c.webp?t=1787123850 width=1560 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You do not need to save the universe with one heroic jump. Sometimes it is enough to deliver the right things without dropping them, start a mechanism, and remember where you threw your mop when leaving this location last time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "An ironic 2D adventure with physics-based challenges and a living world shaped by your actions. Clear away trash, scrub grime, throw and recycle objects. Travel freely between locations by elevator.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5087650/77aef3791115daf993d94474bbbcd5ee0dd36693/header.jpg?t=1787123850", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5087650/35ed661962755cf76c9618b3a506da453bb82e72/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787123850", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5087650/35ed661962755cf76c9618b3a506da453bb82e72/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787123850", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 / AMD Ryzen 3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4000 / AMD Radeon equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible sound card<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> no</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Semenova Alena"], "publishers": ["Semenova Alena"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 18, "description": "Partial Controller Support"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}, {"id": "3"